CHARACTER REFERENCE READ: EP006 Wangmiao canonical sheet and p2-1 panel; EP006 Shi Qiang canonical sheet and p3-1 panel; EP010 Yang Dong canonical sheet. Read before generation.
Wangmiao 1/3: Slim Chinese man with softly angular youthful face, neat but slightly spiky black hair, wide eyes and thick dark brows.
Wangmiao 2/3: Large round horn-rimmed glasses, bright white lens reflection; blue-grey button shirt with sleeves rolled neatly, no lab coat.
Wangmiao 3/3: Restrained scholar posture; medium-bold black ink contours, angular black shadow planes and cool blue-grey flat cell shading match EP006 p2-1.
Shi Qiang 1/3: Heavy-set Chinese man with broad rugged face, tousled black hair, thick brows, narrowed tired eyes and dense dark stubble.
Shi Qiang 2/3: Worn olive-green field jacket over loose pale collared shirt, unlit cigarette held between fingers.
Shi Qiang 3/3: Wary dry expression and forward-leaning weight; bold black outlines, sharp dark beard marks and flat olive/blue-grey shadows match EP006 p3-1.
Yang Dong 1/3: Young Chinese woman with oval slightly long face, narrow forehead, slim straight nose, fine brows, calm almond eyes and small mouth.
Yang Dong 2/3: Straight glossy black hair below shoulders, side-swept fringe from her left to right; pale sky-blue blouse beneath grey cardigan, brown leather document bag.
Yang Dong 3/3: Quiet observant expression and modest posture; crisp medium-bold ink, simple black shadow facets and controlled flat cool shading match EP010 canonical sheet.
